{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「十優港姐」麥明詩（Louisa）與機師老公盛勁為（Keith）結婚兩年，仔仔至今已1歲大，而麥明詩亦轉型為商界女強人，與演藝界雙向發展，亦不時與圈中人聚會，且出入上流社會。日前麥明詩在社交媒體分享上半年的開心片段，除了為樂易玲、朱千雪慶生，原來麥明詩平時都會帶兒子到澳牛食飯，十分貼地。</p><figure><img alt=\"麥明詩。(麥明詩ig圖片)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260128/1093176961603473408537908.jpeg/-GzbPxObbTKEZD7OO0IGu-Oj2-4y3OCxmNWXv5jVl78\"/><figcaption>麥明詩。(麥明詩ig圖片)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"麥明詩一家三口。（IG@louisa_mak）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260530/1137447429826678784379184.jpeg/k2r6kFadJzBvCwkdBZH1zm5CrO8vnvAngxQuLoMULi4\"/><figcaption>麥明詩一家三口。（IG@louisa_mak）</figcaption></figure><p>麥明詩為樂易玲朱千雪慶生  帶仔仔貼地食澳牛</p><p>麥明詩近日在Instagram及小紅書與網民分享生活片段。麥明詩與圈中姊妹朱千雪慶祝生日，即使朱千雪已經淡出幕前，但兩人關係仍然極佳，不時相約食飯聚會，兩位靚女同場畫面養眼。此外麥明詩又為TVB高層樂易玲慶生，樂易玲更裝作咀咀麥明詩，關係融洽。</p><p>另外麥明詩亦不忘分享與兒子的生活片段，麥明詩帶兒子到澳牛貼地食飯，一家人享受親子時光，歎牛奶炒蛋和多士；麥明詩仔仔在懷中可愛地手指指桌上的餐單，探索新事物，相信長大後與麥明詩一樣聰明！麥明詩幸福地說：「2026已過了一半了！近來日常」。</p><figure><img alt=\"麥明詩與朱千雪慶生。（IG@louisa_mak）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150475713128828928716203.png/pQdG2ydYAeAt2L0RypgRJ6b_IVEJFOhJlZ1J05WdSdM\"/><figcaption>麥明詩與朱千雪慶生。（IG@louisa_mak）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"同樂易玲交情佳！（IG@louisa_mak）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150475710473703424605719.png/GfQYreUylmtcz7xjLMmqnJ2rO3QIr6sZwwOb2sMDm9o\"/><figcaption>同樂易玲交情佳！（IG@louisa_mak）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"帶仔仔食澳牛。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150475736302751744081973.png/1A7-wobYGQInjPe6RC-GomeB4E9_GBE4ixLu-IsS7vg\"/><figcaption>帶仔仔食澳牛。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"行展覽。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150475733823787008923145.png/02sglLoUsMJEsDgSy-NdAehKp160hh_LqefEhKnnxIQ\"/><figcaption>行展覽。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"睇靚景。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150475731223187456068517.png/u4y0FhcAc3CILQQafPZbt4DDpCJip5gfnSrS4p0q0uI\"/><figcaption>睇靚景。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"麥明詩如今生活幸福。（IG@louisa_mak）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150475728786165760783906.png/tWSybfT96L-lmXnDyX8wnh3BMkkIJ_i-yHnNOsh5zTo\"/><figcaption>麥明詩如今生活幸福。（IG@louisa_mak）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"開心！（IG@louisa_mak）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260705/1150475726495944704521479.png/riz8We133o7Liq105iMhVxbUUmfJC-tQKzjQRis40EY\"/><figcaption>開心！（IG@louisa_mak）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-05T14:14:19.486731+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":575,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}